#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_af_calendar
msgid ""
"\n"
"Afghanistan Shamsi (Jalali / Solar Hijri) Calendar for Odoo 17\n"
"==============================================================\n"
"\n"
"Compatible with both Odoo 17 Community and Enterprise editions.\n"
"\n"
"Activates automatically when the user language is Dari (fa_IR) or Pashto (ps_AF).\n"
"All other languages remain fully Gregorian — no configuration needed.\n"
"\n"
"Dari month names:   حمل، ثور، جوزا، سرطان، اسد، سنبله، میزان، عقرب، قوس، جدی، دلو، حوت\n"
"Pashto month names: وری، غويی، غبرګولی، چنګاښ، زمری، وږی، تله، لړم، لیندۍ، مرغومی، سلواغه، کب\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"--------\n"
"* Date / datetime pickers with Afghan month names\n"
"* Search & filter panel with Jalali date domains\n"
"* Group By week / month / quarter / year with Jalali labels\n"
"* PDF reports and Excel exports — Shamsi dates\n"
"* Chatter / log notes / activity due-dates — Shamsi timestamps\n"
"* Calendar views — Jalali navigation and headers\n"
"* Invoice sequence numbering aware of Jalali year boundaries\n"
"* No third-party Python libraries required\n"
"* Works on both Odoo Community and Enterprise\n"
"\n"
"Support\n"
"-------\n"
"Email:   faridullahqaderi54@gmail.com\n"
"Phone:   +93 788 707 479\n"
"Country: Afghanistan\n"
msgstr ""

